# The pools `./pools.sh autoscale` resizes. One line per pool:
#
#   cp autoscale.conf.example autoscale.conf   # gitignored, edit freely
#
# <name> must also be declared in pools.conf, which still supplies the repo,
# label and limits; its count there is ignored while it's autoscaled.
# <min> is kept warm even with nothing queued -- 1 saves the first job the
# 30-60s a runner takes to start and register. [idle_minutes] is how long a
# pool must have no busy runner and no queued job before it drops back to
# <min>; 10 if omitted.
#
# name               min  max  idle_minutes
issue-worm-pro       1    8
sing-attune          0    3    5
